(ra-review
  "docs/coherence-substrate/reciprocal-choice-microkernel-two-observations-review-round-2.md"
  "This is a final focused review after the round-two symmetry repairs. Review adversarially and independently; do not edit any file. Verify both observations and the link. Specifically test whether source 2 is honestly declared-charges rather than intuition; all 1/3/5 values are step budgets; mode and duration triplets are independently selected and the crossed-axis do-plus-long control can falsify coupling; observation 2 has a distinct explicit-carry-ack fixture event without claiming a live human act; point 2 is linked to the prior open id without claiming the kernel closes it or makes an external participant wait; candidate eligibility operands are retained; both mixed fallback orientations independently witness either role's interrupt; and neutral state 1 remains separate from its audible NL surface humm. Expected native band is 4194303. Distinguish protocol invariants from falsifiable trace comparisons. Return OVERALL VERDICT (PASS, REVISE, or BLOCK), separate verdicts for observation 1, observation 2, and linked inference, any remaining located overclaim or mechanical defect, claims permitted verbatim, and the smallest executable repair still required. If no executable repair is required for health as a fixture walk, say so explicitly and name only the next frontier toward a live reciprocal organ.")
